  "title": "PA Forms — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PerformanceManagement.PAForm",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>An employee's appraisal form for a period, in the older model: the plan, quarterly reviews, mid-year and year-end reviews, with sign-off and summary comments. Its KPI lines are held on the plan and review lists. Each employee can have one form per period.</p><p>The submission boxes record progress; they do not lock the form. The dashboard counts the plan, mid-year and year-end submissions, and the PA summary report shows the moderated score and comments.</p>",
